  "quotePolicyRule": "S37 (the maintainer 2026-11-08, freeze item B, near.ai inference-sdk ff591054 policies): teemoon's own checks, before and beside dcap-qvl. quote:debug — a TD quote (gateway, model, GPU node or compose manager) whose TDATTRIBUTES byte 0 bit 0 (TUD.DEBUG) is set is evidence, whether or not Intel answers. reportData:mismatch — a report_data field the gateway or a model node advertises that is not the quote's own report_data is evidence (absent: nothing to compare). modelMrConfig:mismatch — a model node quote whose mr_config is not 0x01 ‖ sha256(app_compose) of the compose it served is evidence, read as the gateway's code identity. nras:absent — a near.ai model node that answered with a quote but no nvidia_payload couldn't be checked: an outage, it asks, never verified, never blocks; the degraded reason and the confirm key are 'the model's hardware attestation is unavailable.'; the GPU row reads 'no nvidia evidence in this attestation' (freeze A2, the maintainer 2026-11-08).",
  "settleTimeout": [
    {"name": "pending-sealed", "sealed": true, "accepted": false, "outcome": "confirmPending"},
    {"name": "pending-sealed-accepted", "sealed": true, "accepted": true, "outcome": "proceed"},
    {"name": "pending-unsealed", "sealed": false, "accepted": false, "outcome": "refuse"},
    {"name": "pending-unsealed-accepted", "sealed": false, "accepted": true, "outcome": "refuse"}
  ],
  "confirmScopeRule": "F4 (formal model): a 'send anyway' confirms one (record, reason) — the record by its fetchedAt and nonce; the reason is the degrade reason whenever one is known (a couldn't-check, policy confirm), even while other checks still run (F4 strict, the maintainer 2026-11-07: one answer covers the record), and 'pending' only when no reason is known yet. The gate after prepareTurn accepts only a confirmation for the record and reason it reads then; anything else asks (pending) or refuses (a soft reason); block is never accepted.",
  "confirmScope": [
    {"name": "same-record-same-reason-proceeds", "confirmed": {"record": "r1", "reason": "pending"}, "gate": {"record": "r1", "reason": "pending", "policy": "allow", "pending": true, "sealed": true}, "outcome": "proceed"},
    {"name": "pending-answer-does-not-cover-a-soft-reason", "confirmed": {"record": "r1", "reason": "pending"}, "gate": {"record": "r1", "reason": "tls:inconclusive", "policy": "confirm", "pending": false, "sealed": true}, "outcome": "refuse"},
    {"name": "a-new-record-asks-again", "confirmed": {"record": "r1", "reason": "pending"}, "gate": {"record": "r2", "reason": "pending", "policy": "allow", "pending": true, "sealed": true}, "outcome": "confirmPending"},
    {"name": "a-soft-reason-answered-for-itself-proceeds", "confirmed": {"record": "r1", "reason": "tls:inconclusive"}, "gate": {"record": "r1", "reason": "tls:inconclusive", "policy": "confirm", "pending": false, "sealed": true}, "outcome": "proceed"},
